# What a Vercel deploy uploads from this repo. The apps are static builds; nothing else is
# needed, and some of what is here must never leave this machine.
#
# Env files first: a local .env.local holds database credentials, and app/.env.local or
# mobile/.env.local would point a public build at a local read service. Build settings for a
# deploy live in the Vercel project, never in an uploaded file.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
.vercel
**/.venv
var
